FROZEN PRIMARY FAMILY

Exactly nine primary tests:

LIQ_ADJUSTED_PRICE

* NEGATIVE — 5 trading days
* NEGATIVE — 7 trading days
* NEGATIVE — 10 trading days

LIQ_REPORTED_VOLUME

* POSITIVE — 3 trading days
